 lm-talk-02-dec-2026\n\nThe Museum of Craft and Design hosts a special tal
 k and 16mm film screening with San Francisco-based artist and filmmaker N
 athan Zack\, presented within the OBJECTS: USA programme. The screening s
 hows footage Zack filmed at JB Blunk’s handbuilt home in Inverness\, fo
 llowed by a conversation about his process. Zack works with film\, embrac
 ing the limitations and unpredictability of analog filmmaking\, 
